        2469,
        1485,
        2642
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Under no circumstances will rental negotiations be en-\ntered into by a public official without prior consultation with\nthe Commissioner of Real Estate. If the allocation of space in a\npublic building entails substantial alteration expenditures, such",
